# Data Directory

This directory is for storing datasets managed by DVC.

## Structure

```
data/
├── raw/          # Original, immutable data
├── processed/    # Cleaned, transformed data
└── features/     # Feature-engineered datasets for ML
```

## Usage

Data files are tracked with DVC and stored externally (S3/GCS).

```bash
# Pull data
dvc pull

# Add new data
dvc add data/raw/orders_2024.csv
```

